window.products.push({"id":996030,"name":"Cottone 100% Cotton Chair Pads w/Ties (Set of 2) | 16” x 15” Round Square | Extra-Comfortable & Soft Seat Cushion | Ergonomic Pillows for Rocking, Din","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qeTvh++tL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Cottone Cottone is all about treating you to affordable everyday elegance. We believe you don’t have to pay a premium to get products that look great, work great, and last. That’s why we use premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. The Chair Pad Set You’ll Love Sinking Into Make your hard chairs a joy to seat on with a chair pad set designed with durable comfort in mind! Cotton chair and bench cushions stand out with their impressively soft cotton cover, extra-comfy cotton filling, and great support. Upgrade your chairs with cotton chair cushions that will feel great years down the line. - Non-irritating and non-static cushion. - Tufted to prevent flattening out. - Multiple ties at the back for non-slip use. - Extra-strong stitching at the seams. - Multiple color and size options. Comfort of Cotton No more scratchiness. No more getting hit by static every time you get up. Cottone chair and bench pads buck the cheap synthetic trend by using 100% cotton not only on the cover but also in the filling. So you end up with a seat cushion with a superior softness and comfort you’ll love. Experience the difference of a chair seat pad that goes natural. Great Fitting Design Cottone pads easily fit the seat of most chairs and benches come in numerous size options for a great fit. Whether you have a rocking chair that needs softening, a high chair that could use a bit more cushion, or a patio chair that needs some comfort upgrading, our pads get the job done without much fuss and have ties to prevent any sliding. Beautiful Color Options Match your furniture or spruce it up with an eye-catching touch of color with the beautiful hues of our chair and bench pads. Cottone seat cushions come in striking shades of white, red, orange, lime green, navy blue, grey, off white, or striped designs, which retain their lovely look even after being washed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qeTvh++tL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottone","source_asin":"B07B4HGHPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4HGHPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4HGHPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996031,"name":"uFarmey Egg Cartons Set - Keep Up To 200 Eggs Fresh And Secure With 12 and 8 Compartment Cartons-and Reusable Egg Trays With Intact Lids,Brown,Medium ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uy3H1e69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare for a scrumptious feast! Make pancakes, waffles, quiches, omelets, and puddings anywhere, anytime. You won’t ever be short of eggs now. There will always be an endless supply of eggs in your kitchen. Maintain and protect your eggs with the practical and convenient egg flats from Ufarmey! Throw your old unmanageable egg basket away that took too much space and created a mess. Also, get rid of those environmentally injurious plastic egg cartons. The material used is pulp, and these trays are biodegradable. Keep your eggs in a natural environment with these egg trays. Being so lightweight, these are easier to carry and put in any place. There are two sizes available to accommodate your needs. The smaller size holds 8 eggs and the larger one is for twelve eggs. These trays have individual compartments that keep the eggs separate, so they don’t bump into each other during transportation. The shape provides maximum protection, and these trays have lids to cover the eggs. You can also stack these trays upon one another as they come with great stability. The soft pulp provides long-lasting protection and freshness by preventing moisture. Premium Features Color: Brown Material: Molded pulp of recycled paper and cardboard It’s a good storage solution for restaurants, bakeries, grocery stores, and convenience stores. These can also be used for egg delivery services VERSATILITY: These egg cartons provide more than one function. You can protect your eggs as well as keep your refrigerator mess-free PREMIUM QUALITY: These are made of high-quality food-grade and non-toxic material. Pulp of paper is used in the formation, which makes it reusable and recyclable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uy3H1e69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uFarmey","source_asin":"B08QCR5TNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCR5TNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCR5TNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
