window.products.push({"id":996112,"name":"GoDear Design Deluxe 99.99% Blackout Thermal Adjustable Sliding Panel Blind 45.8\"- 86\" W x 96\" H, Extendable 4-Rail Track, Metallic Luster Trimmable N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZzZf64kAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LIGHT BLOCKING】Our blackout series sliding panel is an innovative solution to block the sunlight and heat. It can block up to 99.99% of the light, reduce glare, reduce heat loss through windows when it's cold, and maintain pleasant temperatures & reduce energy costs all year round. 【SHIMMERING】Four panels are made of paper-woven fabric that is combined with thermal backing. The lustrous effect will be seen due to the aluminum film applied in the middle. 【BRING THE NIGHT TO ANY ROOMS】Creates maximum privacy during both day and night. It is ideal for bedrooms, nurseries, dark rooms, and media/theater rooms. It also can protect furniture and floors from sun damage and fading. Perfect solution for patio door, balcony door, French door, sliding glass door, large picture window, and any large windows. Fresh alternatives to your traditional vertical blinds, curtains and draperies. 【ADJUSTABLE】The cordless 4-rail track is adjustable anywhere from 45.8\" to 86\" wide (Max width: 86 in & Min width: 45.8 in). 4 panels included and the dimension of each panel is 23\" wide and 96\" tall. Panels attached with Velcro and simply trim the panel height to what you need and install the bottom bars for a custom-look finish. 【STACK OPTIONS】This panel track can be mounted to the wall or ceiling and, moreover, there are 2 control stack options, you can easily slide with a solid metal wand all the way to the right or left. 【INSTALLATION】GoDear panel track blinds are designed specifically for DIY and easy installation, you can choose different installation methods (wall or ceiling) according to your needs. (1) Inside Mount: Minimum 2.5-inch depth needed; (2) Outside Mount: Minimum 2.25-inches of bracket height required on the top. 【KID & PET FRIENDLY】GoDear is committed to kids safety and we only offer cordless systems certified by the Best for Kids program. Cordless sliding panels are best for families with young children, seniors and pets. 【BACKSIDE COLOR】White (Non-woven backing)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZzZf64kAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoDear Design","source_asin":"B07RS97X8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RS97X8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RS97X8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
