window.products.push({"id":996255,"name":"Phoenix Coffee Mug. Phoenix gift 11 oz. black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sb0MxL03L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Creativity: Buy awesome Phoenix coffee mug for the one you know, the one you work with or the one with you are related to! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to express your love and gratitude towards your special one. That special one may be your friend, parent, better half, colleague, your boy or girl friend. It doesn’t a matter. Creative gifts will be liked by all. Best Quality: We will do our best and will supply you with a high quality ceramic mug printed in the USA. All ceramic cups are dishwasher and microwave safe with with large easy grip handle. The imprinted is printed on both sides of the mug and guaranteed to last. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! Unique and funny: There are only few things that have the power to connect people from all around the world. Coffee is one such thing. This unique Phoenix mug is a great occasion to discuss a lot with just a cup of coffee in our hands. Nothing can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee with some uncommon coffee mugs. So gifting the funny coffee mugs is a great idea to make them remember you with every sip they take. Stylish: Hold a stylish and awesome coffee mug in your hand, you make a stylish statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title , add to your collection and show how awesome you are. Memorable: Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and also for all who enjoy the quality of art. When you buy our personalized coffee mug to someone, either they will preserve it to their collections or they will find a cup of coffee for themselves. Whatever it may be they will remember you every morning. Design:W695","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sb0MxL03L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Mugs","source_asin":"B06Y4NJNPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y4NJNPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y4NJNPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996256,"name":"Philips Viva Digital Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology - Black (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612cJTUKWAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description With the Philips Aifryer you can eat healthier without giving up the taste and texture of your favorite foods. Using its unique Rapid Air Technology, the Airfryer fries, bakes, roasts and grills with a tablespoon or less of oil making it a perfect solution for fast and healthy meals and snacks. Amazon.com With the Philips Airfryer, you can eat healthier without giving up the taste and texture of your favorite foods. Using its unique Rapid Air Technology, the Airfryer fries, bakes, roasts and grills with a tablespoon or less of oil making it a perfect solution for fast and healthy meals and snacks. Product Features With the Airfryer you can fry, bake, grill and roast: Not just great for frying, the innovative Philips Airfryer with Rapid Air technology also lets you grill, bake and even roast your favorite dishes for a one stop solution for all of your meals. Digital touchscreen interface: The digital touchscreen interface lets you easily customize the settings to cook your food exactly as you want. The Philips Airfryer's integrated timer allows you to preset cooking times up to 60-minutes and includes a ready indicator and auto-off function. The fully adjustable temperature control allows you to preset the best cooking temperature for your food up to 390°F. Enjoy crispy golden fries, snacks, chicken and more all prepared at the right time and temperature for the best result! Rapid Air Technology circulates hot air with speed and precision for perfect results with a tablespoon or less of oil: Using Rapid Air Technology, the Airfryer circulates hot air around a metal mesh cooking basket, requiring little or no oil as it fries, bakes and grills. The starfish design on the bottom of the Airfryer facilitates air circulation, ensuring your favorite foods cook evenly. Unique design for delicious and low-fat cooking results: Philips Airfryer's unique design which combines fast circulating superheated air, starfish design and optimal heating profile allows you to fry a variety of delicious meals in a fast, easy and healthier way without necessarily adding oil. Dishwasher safe parts for a quick and easy clean up: The removable nonstick coated drawer and the food basket are dishwasher safe for a quick and easy clean up. Philips Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology saves you and your home from the smell of fried oil comparted to a regular fryer. Philips Certified Refurbished: Philips certified refurbished AirFryers have been stripped down, cleaned out, reassembled and thoroughly tested. They’re restored to a fully functional condition. In short, they are everything a Philips machine should be. Philips refurbishes units that are returned to us by retailers or consumers. Refurbishing these machines, rather than disposing of them, means that the parts and materials are re-used instead of wasted.  When a machine comes to us to be refurbished, it is first stripped down as far as necessary. Components removed from the machine that meet our high standards of quality are kept and cleaned. Most damaged or broken components are sent away for recycling. The core of the machine is thoroughly cleaned and new parts are added to replace damaged or cosmetically unacceptable parts discovered during the stripping down process. Just like our brand new machines, the rebuilt machine then undergoes a comprehensive series of electrical and performance tests to ensure that it works as it should. One of the primary differences between a new Philips machine and a refurbished Philips machine is its appearance– a scratch here or there may provide a clue that it has been previously used. After it has passed all of the tests, the machine is then packaged and sent out. All Philip refurbished units come with a 90 Day parts and labor warranty.    Fry, bake, grill and roast  Touchscreen controls Perfect results with a tablespoon or less of oil  Unique design for delicious and low-fat cooking results Dishwasher safe parts for a quick and easy clean up  Digital AirFryer Specifications 60-Minute Timer 1.8lb Capacity Digital touch-screen interface Time and temperature control Automatic shut-off Cord storage Non-slip feet Ready signal Temperature light Patented Rapid Air Technology","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612cJTUKWAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B016OSM96Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016OSM96Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016OSM96Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996257,"name":"Visual Timer for Kids and Adults, 60-Minute Countdown Timer with Silent Operation and Time Management Tool, Classroom Timer Fit for Kids Desks, Homesc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5qx+dNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Time Management】Do you or your child have trouble with procrastination or poor time perception? the visual timer can SEE the time going away, and help the kid smooth transitions and understand the concept of time. Also, This 60-minute countdown timer helps to stay on task and concentrate during study and work time. Great for kids or adults managing their time. 【Simple Setting & Optional Audible Alert】Turn the knob clockwise to the desired time interval then the timer is on (Turn the timer back to zero it will off). When the colored disc reaches \"0\", the time is over. Then the bell will ring. Alert noise when time is up is optional. Low and Loud. It's not jarring. Requires 2 \"AAA\" batteries (Not Included). 【Silent Operation】This classroom timer is a great tool for managing study time or work time, It doesn’t make any annoying ticking noises while it’s running. You can use it while working and studying to avoid distractions and interruptions, and stay productive and on task. classroom timer is perfect for reading, studying, taking tests, and doing projects. 【Wide Application】This 60-minute visual timer provides a visual reminder or visual reinforcement to create awareness of time. you can use it for a countdown timer, classroom timer, study timer, kids timer, toddler timer, kitchen timer, and more! Suitable for the classroom, home, kitchen, gym, office, and special needs. 【Carry Friendly and Warranty】The timer size are 2.9*2.9*1.7inches, weight：0.17lb (Note: batteries Needed, not included). It is lightweight and compact, convenient for you to carry around. In addition, We provide a two-year warranty. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5qx+dNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NRGready","source_asin":"B0BLS54V1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLS54V1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLS54V1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
