window.products.push({"id":996307,"name":"CAEKAIGTA Chopsticks Reusable, Wooden Dragon and Phoenix Chopsticks, Reusable Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe,Chopsticks Set Gift Box packaging（2 pairs）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P92V6XbiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safety&Environmental Protection】: Use high-quality, heat-resistant logs as materials, which are not easy to bend and corrode. Wood materials are biodegradable, which avoids environmental problems and is safer and more environmentally friendly. 【Unique Design】:The dragon and phoenix patterns are carved on the head of the chopsticks, typical Chinese classical style, smooth surface, the design of the tip of the chopsticks makes it easier to pick up food and not easy to slip off. 【Easy To Use】:9 inches long, lighter than metal chopsticks, easy to hold, friendly to beginners, and very suitable for adults or children. 【Portable Package】: Each package is equipped with 2 pairs of chopsticks (long and phoenix chopsticks), 2 chopstick holders (dragon holder and phoenix holder) and a cloth bag, which is easy to carry and suitable for family dinner, travel and camping. 【Gift Implication】: Exquisite wooden box packaging, flying dragon's auspicious meaning and meaning, is a very good gift for you and your family, friends and customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P92V6XbiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAEKAIGTA","source_asin":"B0BDRL618S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRL618S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRL618S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996308,"name":"Mayberry Corner Custom Road and Street Signs for Bedroom and Outdoors, Customized Metal Road Sign, Personalized Road Sign for Address, Custom Road Sig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gl-mNuTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We've had a lot of fun designing these signs. A sign that is perfectly rated to be outdoors but yet the rustic styled ones look like they've had some very bad, no good, horrible years outdoors. Looks like you found it in your grandfather's barn or the likes. These signs are metal (aluminum) faced on both the front and the back. The center core is an outdoor rated polymer that is bonded to the aluminum faces. It is an excellent hybrid material that takes advantage of the stiffness of the aluminum and the lightness of the polymer core to make an easy to hang, long lasting sign for indoors or out. The artwork is printed directly onto the white painted metal and the inks are outdoor rated as well. SPECIFICATION: HandmadeMaterials: MetalHeight: 7 inches, Width: 28 inches, Depth: 3 millimeters PERSONALIZATION: Add your personalizationPlease enter the following information. 1. The main text for your sign2. Any Super scripted text you want (DR, RD, LN, etc.)3. Notes. Example: \"I'd like to see a mock up\" (may take 1-2 days more) Unless told otherwise, we usually capitalize all text. These make a great way to really personalize a backyard or a bedroom wall.1- The 5 x 20 inch versions are a \"mini\" version of a street sign; they are best used for wall decor; they may look a bit small on a street post.2- The 7 x 28 inch versions are the ones shown in the photos above; we think they are the best size for the two sided outdoor signs.3- The 9 x 36 inch versions are large and are meant to have a large presence hung on a wall (indoor or out).4- The 11 x 44 inch tall versions are very large and are meant to have a huge presence hung on a wall (indoor or out).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gl-mNuTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayberry Corner","source_asin":"B099R4WS31","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099R4WS31","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099R4WS31","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
