window.products.push({"id":996370,"name":"Ameriwood Home Sienna Park TV Stand up to 65\" in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":292.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FAro+EsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring back the stylings of the European 19th century with the Ameriwood Home Sienna Park TV Stand. The TV Stand can accommodate most flat screen TVs up to 65 wide or up to 120 lbs. Made of laminated MDF and particleboard, this gorgeous Stand is designed with a classic white finish and unique louvered doors with decorative cremone bolt finishes to give this TV Stand the perfect finishing touch. Three center shelves are open to hold your entertainment consoles and a DVD player. The 2 doors open up to additional adjustable shelves. Each shelf has a sufficient amount of wire management cutouts to keep all of your electronics organized and the cords tangle-free. The TV Stand ships flat to your door and requires assembly upon opening. Two adults are recommended to assemble. Once assembled, the Stand measures to be 30.5H x 59W x 18.5D.Features :- Give your entertainment space a classic European update with the Ameriwood Home Sienna Park TV Stand for TVs up to 65 wide or 120 lbs- Made of laminated MDF and particleboard, the classic white finish pairs with the louvered doors and cremone bolt for a beautiful 19th century European feel- Place your DVD player, audio equipment, and gaming systems on the 3 open center shelves that features wire management cutouts to keep your cords organized- Behind the 2 louvered doors are additional adjustable shelving to organize your DVDs and video games- The TV Stand ships flat to your door and 2 adults are recommended to assemble. The TV Stand can hold up to 120 lbs. Each shelf will hold 15 lbs..Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 30.5H x 59W x 18.5D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FAro+EsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameriwood Home","source_asin":"B0815QQYRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0815QQYRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0815QQYRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996371,"name":"SuJolly Rocket Whiskey Decanter for Space Lover, Adventurer or Risk Taker, Space Shuttle Whisky Dispenser for Astronomy Enthusiast or Planetarium, Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iK6mWFjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rocket & Space Shuttle Shaped Whiskey Decanter: Inspired by the sapce shuttle and rocket, this decanter represents the fearless spirit of exploration, discovery, and innovation, which helps us continue to move forward in life. This decanter is perfect for showing your admiration, appreciation and respect to those who loves exploring the unknown and seeking exciting adventures. Perfect Gift Idea: It’s not only a ultimate gift for space lovers, pilots, astronomy enthusiast or planetarium, but also an excellent gift for risk takers like your clients, your boss or your business partners on any occasions like Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Father’s Day, Valentine's Day, Anniversary, Birthday, Graduation Day, Retirement, Wedding or House Warming. A Great Addition to Your Home Bar: Its sleek and aerodynamic glass design makes it look like a rocket flying through space. It comes with 4 glasses to fit perfectly into the wooden base. The decanter's copious volume provides you with an extra-large 1000ml capacity to store and serve your favourite liquor. Lead-free Handcrafted Borosilicate Glass: Our lead-free decanter is handcrafted from high-end borosilicate glass which is known for both strength and heat resistance. It is an ideal container for any refined liquors, including bourbon, scotch, rum, brandy or vodka, even cold juice or iced tea. It does not change the color, taste, or alter the nuances of your favorite alcoholic beverages. 2 Years Free Guarantee: At SuJolly, we promise 2 YEARS FREE GUARANTEE for your decanter set. If you are not satisfied, we will make you a full refund or replacement. This rocket-shaped whiskey decanter set is an absolute must-have for any gentleman who loves whiskey or any other well-made spirit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iK6mWFjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SuJolly","source_asin":"B0BJ866W5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ866W5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ866W5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
