window.products.push({"id":996376,"name":"Spode Christmas Tree - Spode 250th Anniversary Christmas Tree Figural Teapot | Christmas Tea Pots for Tea Party | Christmas Teapot - Fine Dolomite | C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m1BRV2FTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Tree Teapot - This fabulously festive tea pot will add a distinctive charm to your home this upcoming holiday. Measuring 7.75\" with a 26.8 Oz capacity, this holiday teapot is a great addition to your Christmas collection and is perfect to mix and match with any other kitchen collections! Our pitcher will look wonderful in your home. Unmistakably Spode - Loved for its nostalgia and warm recollections of Christmases past, Spode’s Christmas Tree is one of the world's best known holiday designs since its introduction in 1938. Our holiday tea pot features a seasonal pattern depicting a decorated Christmas tree, colorful gifts, and mistletoe accents. Built To Last - Made from durable dolomite, the Spode Christmas tea pot is strong and made to last for many Christmases to come. This beautiful yet sturdy piece can be passed down from generation to generation. To clean, hand washing the tea pitcher is recommended to maintain finish and function. Festive And Fun - Beautiful detailing of baubles and gifts decorate the Spode Christmas Teapot, with a handle fashioned like a ribbon and a peppermint stripe spout. It will look wonderful on any mantel or table. This teapot also features the celebratory Spode 250th Anniversary backstamp. Let the celebrations begin! Amazing Gift Idea - The Spode Christmas Tree teapot is a fun and stunning gift for your family and friends. It's a great gift for special occasions including holidays, housewarming, and more. With a fun and festive theme, this collectible teapot will fit great in any home and is perfect for the joyous season!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m1BRV2FTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spode","source_asin":"B08N82DV3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N82DV3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N82DV3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
