window.products.push({"id":996452,"name":"Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Cashmere Brush with Oiled Beechwood Handle, 10-Inches Long, Two Layers of Bristles for Gentle and Thorough Cleaning, Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716URmEmgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your cashmere looking like new with the Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Cashmere Brush with Oiled Beechwood Handle. Best for cleaning, treating and restoring fine cashmere, this brush removes lint, fuzz and dust from cashmere, wool or knit items. Strung with all-natural pig bristle that is soft and gentle enough for delicate fabrics, this handy brush features a beautiful oiled beechwood handle that ages gracefully and fits comfortably in hand. Durable enough for daily use, a leather strap offers convenient hanging storage. Brush measures 10-inches long. Before being strung into the brush head, the pig bristle is cleaned, scoured and combed in a multi-stage process. This finishing treatment ensures the utmost quality and optimizes the benefits of pig bristles. For maintenance, it is recommended to clean with a mild soap and warm water solution. Towel blot to remove excess moisture and hang to air dry with bristles facing down to prevent damage to wooden handle. Comb out gently using a metal comb and then hang on a hook or lay flat for storage. Made in Germany. The first handcrafted Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes were produced in 1935. A lot has changed since then. Today, the name Bürstenhaus Redecker stands as it has for many years for an ideal combination of natural quality, function and design. It lives from the blend of inventiveness, sound craftsmanship and creativity. Handcrafted in Germany, Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes are made of domestic woods, bristles, hair, and plant fibers, and have been for decades. Precedence is given to natural, sustainable raw materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716URmEmgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDECKER","source_asin":"B0BWVG3JY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWVG3JY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWVG3JY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
