window.products.push({"id":996641,"name":"Deny Designs Stacey Schultz Circle World Red Throw Pillow, 18 x 18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f-PiC-qEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wanna transform a serious room into a fun, inviting space? Looking to complete a room full of solids with a unique print? Need to add a pop of color to your dull, lackluster space? Accomplish all of the above with this simple, yet powerful indoor throw pillow! Available in four sizes, this throw pillow is made from a medium weight woven polyester with a hidden zipper and removable bun insert. Recommended for indoor use only. Based in Denver, Colorado, Deny Designs is a modern, think-outside-the-box home furnishings company. Deny empowers its customers to transform dull, everyday household accessories into fun and original statement. With each purchase, our team of talented artists earn part of the proceeds, enabling Deny to support art communities all over the world while also spreading the creative love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f-PiC-qEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B0725TPDF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725TPDF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725TPDF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996642,"name":"Fully Assembled Christmas Photo Booth Props - Set of 32 - Red, Green, and Gold Selfie Signs - Holiday Party Supplies & Decorations - Cute Xmas Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819zpTUhpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FULLY ASSEMBLED = NO WASTED TIME GLUING THEM TOGETHER 🌟 Your Christmas photo booth props will arrive to you in a sturdy box, already pre-assembled onto thick 9.5 inch wooden sticks. All you have to do is take them out of the box and you’re ready to go! We also include 32 glue dots that are optional to use in case you want to add even more support. We’ve seen many of our customers use the glue dots to add a few of the props to their walls as added party decor! FUN DESIGNS MAKE YOUR PARTY AND PHOTOS STAND OUT 🌟 We put a lot of thought into designing each photo prop ourselves to ensure that every sign was super cute and perfect for your Christmas party. They work well in pictures (of course!), as centerpieces, or wall decor. STURDY CARDSTOCK AND STICKS WILL LAST ALL PARTY LONG 🌟 Our Christmas photo booth props are made of 350 gsm card stock, which means they are THICK. This high quality means they can hold up to being used all night long (plus they come packaged in a box that you can store them in to re-use for future xmas parties if you'd like). The dowels we used are made of thick quality wood, so they won’t break or fray. SET OF 32 MEANS LOTS OF (CUTE) OPTIONS 🌟 Our large set of 32 props includes plenty of options for everyone to choose from. We didn’t just throw together a bunch of random props out there though. We made sure they all coordinated and included a good mix of sayings, cute hats and glasses, and fun signs/props unique for yourChristmass party! There are so many options that everyone will find plenty they want to use! REAL GLITTER ADDS REAL SPARKLE TO YOUR PARTY 🌟 The real gold glitter that sets us apart from other photo booth kits will set your Christmas party apart too! The no DIY holiday signs save you time and add that extra touch to elevate your party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819zpTUhpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Occasion","source_asin":"B08FKPK7FF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FKPK7FF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FKPK7FF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
