window.products.push({"id":996829,"name":"Rival VSA3 Seal-a-Meal Accessory Canisters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APKTWQM9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Buy cereal and cookies in bulk and put up a week's worth of dinners. Food stays fresh longer when stored in these airtight Seal-A-Meal accessory canisters The plastic containers work well in the fridge and on the countertop. To lock in freshness, simply connect the universal sealer and hose to the lid of one of the plastic canisters, then switch on the vacuum food sealer (sold separately) to extract the air. The system also works on mason jars, which is great news for those who love making jelly and pickles. Available in 3 sizes: 3/4, 1-1/2 and 2-1/2 qt. Dishwasher safe. Imported. Amazon.com If youre into time-saving cooking and shopping tricks, such as doubling a recipe for several days worth of dinners or buying snacks or cereal in bulk to reduce shopping time, store food properly in these airtight canisters. Compatible with Rivals Seal-A-Meal vacuum food sealer, this set comes with an accessory sealer, hose, and three storage canisters. When used with the main vacuum food sealer (sold separately), these accessories will provide an airtight seal to keep leftovers or treats fresher longer. To operate, one end of the hose goes into the universal sealer while the other attaches to the Seal-A-Meal vacuum sealer. The universal sealer goes over the top of the canisters lid and turning on the Seal-A-Meal vacuum sealer sucks all air out of the food container. The process works on the included ¾-quart, 1-1/2-quart, and 2-1/2-quart canisters for sealing leftover soups and casseroles or storing uncooked pasta or dried fruits, and also works on Mason jars for making jams or pickling. Containers are safe to store either in the refrigerator or a countertop. This unique storage method saves families money and reduces waste. Rival covers this accessory kit under a limited one-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APKTWQM9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rival","source_asin":"B0000BVQE1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000BVQE1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000BVQE1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
