window.products.push({"id":996939,"name":"Amyove TV Stand for 65 Inch TV, Farmhouse Entertainment Center TV Media Console Table, Tall TV Stand with Storage, Barn Doors and Shelves, White Moder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r86Epc-iL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FARMHOUSE TV STAND: This white entertainment center is designed with a combination of modern and traditional farmhouse styles. The clean-lined and scientific and rational layout ensures ample storage space, making this farmhouse tv stand not only elegant and beautiful but also highly practical. The wood tv stand can perfectly match any style of room decor and is perfect for a farmhouse, living room, bedroom, or as storage cabinet in the kitchen. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: The TV console table overall size is 59” L x 15.7” W x 27.6” H. It is suitable for flat screen and curved TVs up to 65 inches. The large TV stand increases the contact area between the bottom and the ground and has a better Weight-bearing performance. The modern tv stand for 65-inch tv gives you ample storage space for media players, game consoles, photo frames, plants, books, tv components, and any other home decor art to keep your living room clean and away from sundries. CHIC ENTERTAINMENT CENTER: This barn door TV stand is designed with two metal handles, the sliding cabinet door is more smooth, and it is easy to access items. The shelves of this modern console table can be adjusted in 3 heights, You can freely adjust the height according to the items you need to store (no need to install again). Designed with cable holes on the back of the entertainment center to store extra cables, this TV stand cleverly hides clutter, big or small. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: The farmhouse tv stand is made of high-grade P2 class particle board and MDF engineered wood, which is strong and durable. The 25MM solid thickened table top provides excellent stability and durability, the wood tv stands top can hold up to 220 lbs and the shelves can hold up to 25 lbs, enough for your needs. High-quality materials and excellent craftsmanship make this living room TV entertainment center sturdy and durable which is no afraid of long time use. EASY ASSEMBLY: This modern tv console table has been checked and well-packed before shipping. You don't need to worry about assembly, the barn doors tv stand comes with detailed installation instructions, parts and accessories are labeled with numbers, and precise holes make installation accurate and fast. 1-2 people can assemble in about 1-2 hours. If you have any questions before or after your purchase, you can always email us, and we always reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r86Epc-iL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amyove","source_asin":"B0C7VMKYCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7VMKYCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7VMKYCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
