window.products.push({"id":996979,"name":"TAWCHES Porcelain Tea Canister Aittight, Tea Bag holder Ceramic Tea Jar Tea Container With Lid For Kitchen Decorative Farmhouse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt7arvq0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The capacity is 28 fluid ounces. Adopt top-notch silicone seal, to be truly air tight. With embossed texture and hand-painted color. Handcrafted from porcelain. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt7arvq0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAWCHES","source_asin":"B08F2R9DVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F2R9DVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F2R9DVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":996980,"name":"Victorinox-Swiss-Army-Cutlery Rosewood Serrated Steak Knives, Pointed-tip, 4.75-Inch, 6-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pD3cmB0VL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description Stylish cutlery is key to have an attractive, memorable dinner, and it's hard to get any more stylish than with this Rosewood spear tip steak knife set by Victorinox. The handles are made of Rosewood, which not only looks great, but is lightweight and durable as well. The color and grain patterns in the wood give the handles a very natural beauty, and add personality to the table. The blading itself is constructed of stainless steel, which provides a high durability and a sharp edge, and resists corrosion and degradation. The knives use specially design spear tips, which are essentially longer and thinner than your traditional steak knife tip, and their serrated edging allow them to keep cutting without sharpening. Previously known as RF Forschner, Victorinox knives are made in Switzerland by the makers of the original Swiss Army Knife. Stemming from pure necessity, master Cutler Karl elsner began producing the original Swiss Army Knife in 1891 to meet the needs of soldiers on the field. Since then, Victorinox has become a fine cutlery Company true to its Swiss roots and professional cutlery precision, quality, functionality and versatility. Victorinox is in the hands of more professionals, from the Meatpacking industry to a four-star restaurant, than any other brand of cutlery. 4-3/4\" L Amazon.com Six of these handsome steak knives from R.H. Forschner by Victorinox come tucked in this press-fit storage box. Each shows a rosewood handle in traditional triple-rivet styling, and a five-inch, serrated blade stamped out of high-carbon, no-stain steel that is hand-finished in Switzerland. Unlike many stamped knives, these have a full tang for superior strength and balance, and the sharp edge slices through a fine steak without tearing. Forschner recommends washing the knives by hand even though they're dishwasher-safe, and covers the set with a lifetime warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pD3cmB0VL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B01N78O7B1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-996980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N78O7B1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N78O7B1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
